Subject: [PATCH] feat(worker-drain): unsent local results hold the census at
 UNKNOWN [daveey]

Stage 2 slice 1 (t_eeeeee0000000017, creator ruling): a zero
census count needs every account board readable with an empty kanban_sync_outbox.
kanban_run_end_lease may drop the Board lease while the completion row is pending,
so process/lease zeros alone could let the scaler terminate a node holding the
only copy of a finished result. Pending, unreadable or missing => UNKNOWN (None).
Tests: pending after real _release, drained, unreadable/corrupt/missing, inventory
failure. Latch, spawn hooks, helper admission and IID fence are NOT in this commit.
